{
  "name": "lxcode-shell",
  "productName": "Lxcode",
  "version": "0.3.34",
  "description": "lxcode 桌面壳（Electron 薄壳，业务在 Go 后端）",
  "main": "dist/main.js",
  "author": "moyunteng",
  "private": true,
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node build.mjs",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "test": "node --import ./tests/register.mjs --test tests/*.test.mjs",
    "dist": "electron-builder --win --x64"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.10.0",
    "electron": "40.10.2",
    "electron-builder": "26.15.3",
    "esbuild": "^0.25.0",
    "typescript": "^5.9.2"
  },
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.moyunteng.lxcode",
    "productName": "Lxcode",
    "npmRebuild": false,
    "directories": {
      "output": "release"
    },
    "files": [
      "dist/**",
      "renderer/**",
      "build/icon.png",
      "build/tray.ico"
    ],
    "extraResources": [
      {
        "from": "resources/bin",
        "to": "bin"
      }
    ],
    "mac": {
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "dmg",
          "arch": [
            "arm64",
            "x64"
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "zip",
          "arch": [
            "arm64",
            "x64"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "category": "public.app-category.developer-tools",
      "icon": "build/icon.png",
      "identity": null,
      "extendInfo": {
        "CFBundleName": "Lxcode",
        "CFBundleDisplayName": "Lxcode",
        "CFBundleIdentifier": "com.moyunteng.lxcode",
        "NSHighResolutionCapable": true
      },
      "extraResources": [
        {
          "from": "resources/bin-darwin",
          "to": "bin"
        }
      ],
      "minimumSystemVersion": "10.15"
    },
    "win": {
      "signtoolOptions": {
        "certificateSubjectName": "CN=lxcode-selfsign",
        "signingHashAlgorithms": [
          "sha256"
        ]
      },
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "nsis",
          "arch": [
            "x64"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "nsis": {
      "oneClick": false,
      "perMachine": false,
      "allowToChangeInstallationDirectory": true,
      "runAfterFinish": true,
      "differentialPackage": false,
      "deleteAppDataOnUninstall": false
    }
  },
  "buildMacNotes": [
    "目标 dmg（分发安装）+ zip（免安装/归档）。arm64+x64 双架构。",
    "electron-builder 自动把 png 转 icns（在 mac 上转换；Windows 交叉打包的实测结论见 scripts/build.mjs --mac）。2026-10 打包定案：暂不做签名/公证。后果：未签名 .app 首次打开会被 Gatekeeper 拦（无法验证开发者）——用户需右键打开一次放行，或 xattr -cr /Applications/Lxcode.app 清隔离属性。",
    "darwin 后端二进制（resources/bin/lxcode，无 .exe）由 scripts/build.mjs --mac 交叉编译后落 resources/bin-darwin/，这里按平台覆盖 extraResources 源目录。"
  ]
}
